@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName DejaVu Sans
skinparam defaultFontSize 16
skinparam dpi 140
skinparam ArrowColor #17354c
skinparam classBackgroundColor #edf5f7
skinparam classBorderColor #087f8c
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
title D01 | Use cases - v1.1
left to right direction
actor "Authenticated user" as U
actor Student as S
actor Lecturer as L
actor "Head of Department" as H
actor Administrator as A
U <|-- S
U <|-- L
U <|-- H
U <|-- A
rectangle LMS {
usecase "UC01 Manage session" as Session
usecase "UC02 Manage school" as School
usecase "UC03 Create assignment" as Assignment
usecase "UC04 Grant extension" as Extension
usecase "UC05 List assignments" as List
usecase "UC06 Submit work" as Submit
usecase "Validate submission" as Validate
usecase "Resubmit work" as Resubmit
usecase "UC07 Mark work" as Mark
usecase "UC08 Moderate" as Moderate
usecase "UC09 Release / reopen" as Release
usecase "UC10 View own results" as Results
}
U --> Session
A --> School
L --> Assignment
L --> Extension
L --> Mark
H --> Moderate
H --> Release
S --> Submit
S --> List
S --> Results
Submit .> Validate : <<include>>
Resubmit .> Submit : <<extend>>
[existing work; RECEIVED; t <= D]
note right of Extension
Individual and class extensions.
Authentication is a precondition;
resource scope is checked per command.
end note
@enduml
